{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Golden cases for the GithubPill eval. known_competitors are repos that a correct search should surface for the idea; recall@5 measures whether they land in the ranked top 5. queries approximate the seven first-search archetypes with fixed text so recall is reproducible without an LLM.",
